00:41:53.250 --> 00:41:55.650
Can you kind of maybe try to do that,

00:41:55.650 --> 00:41:57.960
or maybe narrate your
own position in relation

00:41:57.960 --> 00:42:00.370
to these two moments as a scholar?

00:42:00.370 --> 00:42:01.203
- That's great.

00:42:01.203 --> 00:42:03.660
I mean, thanks, Matt, for the question.

00:42:03.660 --> 00:42:05.410
And I'd like to bring,
you know, Anthony in

00:42:05.410 --> 00:42:07.070
