00:43:11.560 --> 00:43:12.830
I'm gonna, go ahead.

00:43:12.830 --> 00:43:15.330
- Also, I think it's really interesting,

00:43:15.330 --> 00:43:17.803
of course, I was thinking about kind of,

00:43:18.960 --> 00:43:21.410
the sort of history and trajectory

00:43:21.410 --> 00:43:23.460
