00:44:36.100 --> 00:44:40.160
in the Middle East than
with white Jews in Israel.

00:44:40.160 --> 00:44:41.570
That's obviously a real problem

00:44:41.570 --> 00:44:43.430
for a lot of American Jews, right?

00:44:43.430 --> 00:44:46.300
Now in our own moment, Christian Zionists,

00:44:46.300 --> 00:44:49.130
who very often are starkly antisemitic

00:44:49.130 --> 00:44:52.133
in some of the most
traditional, terrible ways,

00:44:53.160 --> 00:44:54.770
they're Zionists, though, right?

00:44:54.770 --> 00:44:57.430
They support the state of
Israel as the Jewish state.

00:44:57.430 --> 00:45:00.177
And so they're off the
hook with a huge swath

00:45:00.177 --> 00:45:02.700
