00:45:55.610 --> 00:45:57.320
So we have slavery on the one hand,

00:45:57.320 --> 00:45:59.550
and we have the Holocaust on the other.

00:45:59.550 --> 00:46:03.595
And I think I'm wondering
if you can say anything

00:46:03.595 --> 00:46:07.140
