about the phenomenon

00:46:34.680 --> 00:46:39.680
of Jewish suffering, it
often predates the Holocaust

00:46:41.970 --> 00:46:46.894
and knowing and naming the nature

00:46:46.894 --> 00:46:48.870
of that systemic oppression,

00:46:48.870 --> 00:46:51.370
usually by the Russian Empire,

00:46:51.370 --> 00:46:54.470
is an important part
of formulating exactly

00:46:54.470 --> 00:46:58.993
what the narrative is that
connects Black people and Jews.

00:47:00.943 --> 00:47:03.350
I believe you are talking
about a phenomenon

00:47:03.350 --> 00:47:06.257
